- [Configuration](https://docs.beam.cloud/v2/vm/configuration.md): Choose VM resources, build images, and configure environment variables and storage
- [Secrets](https://docs.beam.cloud/v2/vm/secrets.md): Bind workspace secrets to VMs, scope credential hosts, and rotate values without restarting
